<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink198-kilavi">
       parattaiyarmaṉaikkaṭ paṉṉāṭṭaṅkip piṉpu āṟṟāmaiyē vāyilāka vanta talaimakaṉai etirppaṭṭatōḻi talaimakaṭkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the confidante who encountered the hero - who came as a mediator, having stayed for many days at the home of the other woman, [and] afterwards unable to bear [his own actions] - to the heroine.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink198">
<l>vaḷaiyaṇi muṉkai vāleyiṟ ṟamarnakai</l>
<l>yiḷaiya rāṭun taḷaiyaviḻ kāṉaṟ</l>
<l>kuṟuntuṟai viṉavi niṉṟa</l>
<l>neṭuntō ḷaṇṇaṟ kaṇṭikum yāmē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>We saw the the noble man with tall shoulders</l>
        <l>Who stood, asking [after her] - in the short ghat</l>
        <l>With a seashore grove in which the bonds [of buds] are loosened [= bloom] - </l>
        <l>[To] young girls [with] forearms adorned [with] bangles [and] beautiful smiles of pure teeth.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
